Performances:
	- thread_local used in generated functions, could it lead to problems for parallel code?
	- Symbolic or not parameters does not change so much the performances
	- Eigen is faster than for cycles
	- compiler optimization could slow down significantly the building process
	☐ use structural zeros instead of zeros? remove zeros initialization in Rx,Ry,Rz
	☐ is alignas useful? removed for now (e.g. "thread_local alignas(size) double buffer[size];")
	☐ optimizing code generated by casadi?
	☐ symbol duplications in robot model (e.g. @1=sin(q_1), @2=sin(q_1)...), solved by cse?
	☐ SX to MX?
	☐ multithreading?

